## New Capabilities Identified

- Streak continuation hint: a short static line displayed near each habit's streak count on
  its card, explaining that marking done again tomorrow continues the streak and that a
  missed day resets it to 1. Rendered as always-visible secondary text (not a toast, popup,
  or browser notification), so it does not conflict with the existing "no
  notifications/reminders" MVP boundary or the single-page/no-nav-menu design constraint.

## Priority Signal

Small, additive UI-copy enhancement to the existing streak display (`StreakBadge` component,
Epic WKhBuVK). No new page, no new navigation, no change to streak arithmetic. Originated
from a user question about how the streak/"done today" reset actually works, sized via
`/peak-workflow:triage` as HEAVY only because no existing TOR ID covers explanatory hint
text — not because it requires broader scope or vision rework.

## Deferred Items

None — this session covered only the streak-hint capability.
